s":0,"tests":38},"supervisor_live_integration_tests":12},"closed_findings":["Actual corpus evidence is verified before pilot acceptance and rechecked after execution.","The actual manifest, locations, evidence and review files have before/after anchors.","Required answer and proof negatives include complete contextual source export mutations.","The report itself is included in the final artifact limit via a bounded fixed-point write.","The accepted resolver rules are reconstructed independently from pinned source imports and reviewed root mounts.","The complete accepted configuration identity table is reconstructed from pinned original Git blobs.","Scoped Git enumeration preserves existing startswith semantics for directory and partial basename prefixes, with literal pathspecs and a final complete scope filter.","Every checked artifact directory is inventoried after its existing complete content checks and rehashed immediately before whole-stage acceptance.","Missing files, added files and same-size content substitutions invalidate the inventory and block acceptance.","Receipts cover graph variants, source fixture Git and index data, source bridge, graph proofs, formal ladder, real pilot selection/report/query proofs, indexing, process enforcement tests and full regression process evidence.","The acceptance aggregator requires artifacts_complete_after.","The regression memory override is an explicit positive CLI value, defaults to 4 GiB, and changes only the separate regression configuration. Other Lean and benchmark limits retain 4 GiB.","The planned new regression experiment uses 6442450944 bytes and records its actual configured limit in the report and supervisor receipt.","Historical report contents are compared with the original Git blob after CRLF-to-LF normalization on both byte strings. Exact original Git blob IDs and exact raw checkout SHA-256 values are retained, and raw checkout bytes must remain identical before and after the run.","The historical CRLF fixture remains byte-identical during inventory collection and substantive content mutation is rejected.","New LF-only manifest04 preserves the exact parsed source universe and mapping. Evidence04 changes only its manifest byte anchor. Earlier CRLF manifest and evidence remain preserved, and the LF anchor survives Git text checkout normalization.","The history check supports a legacy CRLF Git blob followed by later LF attributes, rejects substantive mutations, and performs no report writes."],"code_and_tests":{"formal/AnswerBinding.lean":{"bytes":3141,"sha256":"5974c1504d8561f1f5997cda80f95e22487eccded38c4ee01b27c43bb4d8beda"},"formal/Checker.lean":{"bytes":2861,"sha256":"da6fd997ea6bb00d8da509f0554b0d85e9e83de0a8c3ae20ddd709ecc64887f5"},"formal/Chromium.lean":{"bytes":520972,"sha256":"e9d138b432caab7138f95f53cffb5ecc2004006b7e89c8b9221338095c447191"},"formal/ChromiumFast.lean":{"bytes":579802,"sha256":"1a839a8ffe10e371f9c818440314c8431a6081122df8ff56f7df774488bbee93"},"formal/ContextualSourceBinding.lean":{"bytes":6111,"sha256":"021b189dd5bb9c90b64b1edce83891b69a25052c1e2afb79ae60e0797a86cf2a"},"formal/FastChecker.lean":{"bytes":7470,"sha256":"3bfe468699ca05b2bc961f6a54269123bb6a85c010abe4d0d19c0218d56c2df7"},"formal/ProofTiming.lean":{"bytes":884,"sha256":"d155a4676b8e7a6629e9fa829a61f036c71fcef2552e9acc701cc7c80bb11210"},"formal/Reachability.lean":{"bytes":5259,"sha256":"6e6e2d01edf9d6f3679213fafcb92934e5844e799f565c820d902d185f1e26dc"},"formal/RunChecker.lean":{"bytes":219,"sha256":"d2fae905bfa64c2974ae6207965043bebcbfc193443c11614cb73add6a7132dd"},"formal/RunFastChecker.lean":{"bytes":230,"sha256":"084fe19b182e70cd1b2281df1ab5b6ee92bf7eccfcae697f9aae5e1f8f210dad"},"formal/SourceByteScanner.lean":{"bytes":11331,"sha256":"0893586d0e2fd09ca27eea7b070693e67cb9bcef003f3da6fba34d7c2a5281a8"},"formal/SourceGraphBinding.lean":{"bytes":8871,"sha256":"6438c674d02d4aed85229bd5c5fbcfe11dc64812ab0ab33318c2e2c4c33c59e2"},"formal/SourceScanner.lean":{"bytes":9704,"sha256":"2b4